 "text": "AGrowStar - Homepage\n-->\nHomepage\n|\n|\nHome\n|\nLocations\nBonaire, GA\nCalhoun, GA\nConway, SC\nDavisboro, GA\nDawson, GA\nFt. Valley, GA\nKingstree, SC\nLynchburg, SC\nRosier, GA\nSylvania, GA\nWrens, GA\n|\nFutures Prices\nMarket Overview\nFutures\nOptions\nCharts\nSpread Chart\nMarket Heat Maps\nStocks\n|\nMarket Commentary\nAg Newswire\nAgWeb\nAg Market Commentary\nUSDA News\nUSDA Reports\n|\nAbout Us\nText & Email Alerts\nTalk to Us\nForms\nProducer Information\nFutures 101\nCommodity Symbols\n|\n|\nCompany Name\nAbout Us\nLocations\nContact Us\nCash Bids\nCash Bids List\nCash Bids Grid\nUSDA Cash Bids\nMarket Data\nMarket Overview\nFutures\nOptions\nCharts\nSpread Charts\nMarket Heat Maps\nHistorical Quotes\nStocks\nNews\nAg Newswire\nFinancial News\nInsideFutures\nUSDA News & Reports\nAg Commentary\nAg Market Commentary\nMarket Commentary by Total Farm Marketing\nWeather\nLocal Weather\nWeather Center\nRadar Maps\nNOAA Weather\nHazard Alerts\nResources\nSite Registration\nMobile Website\nTrading Calendar\nFutures 101\nCommodity Symbols\nReal-Time Quotes\nCME Resource Center\nFarmers Almanac\nUSDA Reports\n|\n|\nAbout AGrowStar\nAGrowStar, LLC is a full service grain merchandising company offering solutions for all sizes of clients and customers. We desire to allow you to make the most of your crop in the marketplace. Your growth is our business!\nOur Philosophy of Business\nTo give such peace of mind to our customers that the products and services received from us will exceed their expectations so that they may focus all their energies and attention on their core business. Simply put: to be taken for granted.\nLocations\nWe have 12 locations throughout Georgia and South Carolina to best serve you. Don't see a location near you? Contact our direct-ship manager , and we can market your grain directly to end-point consumers from your farm, and we can arrange transportation.\nNewswire\nEricson/Spalding Weighted Average Livestock Market USDA - Sat Oct 17, 4:38PM UTC\nWeston Livestock Auction USDA - Sat Oct 17, 3:50PM UTC\nCrossville Cattle Auction USDA - Sat Oct 17, 1:46PM UTC\nWV Special Graded Feeder Cattle Sale/South Branch Valley USDA - Sat Oct 17, 12:34PM UTC\nCampbellsville Livestock Auction USDA - Sat Oct 17, 11:41AM UTC\nNational Fruit and Vegetable Retail Report USDA - Fri Oct 16, 10:47PM UTC\nCattle Rally into the Weekend, as Cash Firms Barchart - Fri Oct 16, 10:05PM UTC\nWheat Weakness Extends into the Weekend Barchart - Fri Oct 16, 10:05PM UTC\nHog Bulls Find Footing on Friday, as Pork Sees Strength Barchart - Fri Oct 16, 10:05PM UTC\nCotton Closes the Week with Mixed Trade Barchart - Fri Oct 16, 10:05PM UTC\nMore news...\n|\nMarket Snapshot\n|\nName | Month | Last | Change | |\nCorn | Dec 26 | 474-2s | -3-6 | |\nCorn | Sep 27 | 494-0s | -3-4 | |\nSoybean | Nov 26 | 1261-2s | -1-6 | |\nSoybean | Jan 27 | 1275-6s | -2-0 | |\nWheat | Dec 26 | 660-4s | -9-4 | |\nWheat | Jul 27 | 683-2s | -7-0 | |\nLean Hogs | Dec 26 | 66.925s | +0.350 | |\nFeeder Cattle | Nov 26 | 341.900s | -0.050 | |\nQuotes are delayed, as of October 17, 2026, 09:40:18 PM CDT or prior.\nWeather Center Click Here\nLocal Weather\nCheck your local Weather\n-->\nForecast\nDetailed Weather\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\nHome |\nContact Us\n© 2026 Barchart.com, Inc. All market data is hosted and powered by Barchart .\nInformation presented is provided 'as-is' and solely for informational purposes, not for trading purposes or advice, and is delayed. No representations are made by Barchart as to its informational accuracy or completeness.\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information\nExchange Delays\nBy using this site, you agree to the storage of cookies on your devices for enhanced navigation, site analysis, and Barchart's marketing. Data sharing with social media platforms might occur based on the privacy choices you make on those platforms. For specifics, see our our Privacy Policy .\nAccept",
